flowchart TD
    A[Start metadata scanner] --> B[Generate sync_run_id]
    B --> C[Read governance.cfg_metadata_source]
    C --> D[Filter is_active = true]
    D --> E{For each source_id}

    E --> F[Build namespace<br/>workspace.lakehouse.schema]
    F --> G[SHOW TABLES IN namespace]
    G --> H{SHOW TABLES success?}

    H -- No --> I[Append failed source record]
    I --> E

    H -- Yes --> J[Apply include/exclude regex]
    J --> K{For each table}
    K --> L[Read Spark schema]
    L --> M{Schema read success?}

    M -- No --> N[Append failed table record]
    N --> K

    M -- Yes --> O[Extract table metadata]
    M -- Yes --> P[Extract column metadata]

    O --> Q[Append governance.stg_table_metadata]
    P --> R[Append governance.stg_column_metadata]

    Q --> S[End scanner]
    R --> S
